        "cooked": "<p>A Southwest Sentinels villain returns.</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-321-tome-of-the-bizarre-vol-4-56-58\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-321-tome-of-the-bizarre-vol-4-56-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a207b25d5dc8a6620aab8ce801ba438ae9da3f25.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" data-dominant-color=\"837B72\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-321-tome-of-the-bizarre-vol-4-56-58\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Episode #321 - Tome of the Bizarre Vol. 4 #56-58</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The title of this episode is misleading...  Show Notes: Run Time: 2: That's right, another 2+ hour episode, but we actually cover a LOT of material in that time! I promise.&nbsp; We start off with some goofs, then some discussion of the method of...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"fSMzf2JjHMAxbisUTbYVwJfboz\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/0/01cba4f0902b49e29503b0729752bc37c316abb7_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"655856\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1989×3075 1.64 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa_2_323x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"A0TA44pGqimouIs2ib2bK6irhbQ\" width=\"323\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa_2_323x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa_2_484x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/fc6834987f71831fd6ba2d43696282c40174f4aa_2_646x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"88774E\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1989×3075 1.56 MB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" hr