      {
        "id": 265668,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-16T17:55:54.774Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Incredible art again this week! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Damn, starting off with some heavy Adam lore this time around! And credit card fraud! XD</p>\n<p>Good on the Patreon for intuiting the Quetzalcoatl connection! Because I have definitely been completely blank on what this prompt might have meant!</p>\n<p>I can’t believe no one came here to learn ancient Aztec languages!</p>\n<p>Why does this speech sound like the lyrics to “The Four Horsemen”? XD</p>\n<p>So when Ra says “By flame reforged!” he’s doing both the flame and reforging himself.</p>\n<p>Hooray for Adam eating! Peaches and raspberries are the best.</p>\n<p>Oh man, I love when Ra does hands, best part of his comics.</p>\n<p>Oh god, there’s a line in a Sentinels movie where Legacy goes, “And Ra? <em>Burn.</em>”</p>\n<p>“Everything’s coming up Quetzalcoatl!”</p>\n<p>I have just discovered that the new setup for Libsyn means I can pause an episode and come back to it later worry of it stopping after like five or ten minutes, which is great.</p>\n<p>This disappointed dad letter is a stellar new bit.</p>\n<p>Damn, I had no idea child-stealing crocodiles were such a problem!</p>\n<p>Surely they knew they had to be making us a new blorbo when they created Tremble. Surely.</p>\n<p>I might pay to see Adam eat an elf though.</p>\n<p>…Oh no. That happened, didn’t it? XD</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
