        "raw": "Incredible art again this week! :)\n\nDamn, starting off with some heavy Adam lore this time around! And credit card fraud! XD\n\nGood on the Patreon for intuiting the Quetzalcoatl connection! Because I have definitely been completely blank on what this prompt might have meant!\n\nI can't believe no one came here to learn ancient Aztec languages!\n\nWhy does this speech sound like the lyrics to \"The Four Horsemen\"? XD\n\nSo when Ra says \"By flame reforged!\" he's doing both the flame and reforging himself.\n\nHooray for Adam eating! Peaches and raspberries are the best.\n\nOh man, I love when Ra does hands, best part of his comics.\n\nOh god, there's a line in a Sentinels movie where Legacy goes, \"And Ra? *Burn.*\"\n\n\"Everything's coming up Quetzalcoatl!\"\n\nI have just discovered that the new setup for Libsyn means I can pause an episode and come back to it later worry of it stopping after like five or ten minutes, which is great.\n\nThis disappointed dad letter is a stellar new bit.\n\nDamn, I had no idea child-stealing crocodiles were such a problem!\n\nSurely they knew they had to be making us a new blorbo when they created Tremble. Surely.\n\nI might pay to see Adam eat an elf though.\n\n...Oh no. That happened, didn't it? XD",
